{"file":"RepoAtlas-0.1.0-v2.zip","bytes":51206,"status":"已读取","plugins":[{"path":".claude-plugin/plugin.json","name":"repo-atlas","description":"Generate, maintain, and query a navigable, AI-friendly knowledge graph (a Repo Atlas) of your codebase. Includes seven coordinated skills: survey, identify-domains, generate-tree, bootstrap-workspace, refresh, validate, and query.","version":"0.1.0","license":"MIT","repository":"https://github.com/SmallChX/repo-atlas","homepage":"https://github.com/SmallChX/repo-atlas","keywords":["atlas","knowledge-graph","documentation","codebase-map","skills"]}],"skills":[{"path":"skills/atlas-bootstrap-workspace/SKILL.md","name":"atlas-bootstrap-workspace","description":"Bootstrap a multi-repo workspace — survey every in-scope repo, generate per-repo atlases in two phases, write the workspace manifest with all bridges as anchored sub-sections, and validate workspace-wide. The workspace manifest is the single source of truth for cross-repo bridges.","headings":["Skill: atlas-bootstrap-workspace","Inputs","Output","Templates (co-located with this skill)","Six-step procedure","Step 1 — Survey every in-scope repo","Step 2 — Discover bridges across the workspace","Step 3 — Compose the workspace manifest","Bridge: <name> {#bridge-<name>}","Step 4 — Generate per-repo atlases in two phases","Step 5 — Persist bridges in the workspace manifest","Step 6 — Workspace-wide validation gate","Interactive Confirmation","Hand-off","Choosing the manifest's home","Layout fork","See also"],"name_hint":"atlas · bootstrap · workspace","description_zh":"初始化多仓库工作区，调查范围内各仓库并分两阶段生成仓库地图，编写以带锚点子节记录全部跨仓库连接的工作区清单，再进行整体校验；该清单是跨仓库连接的唯一权威来源。"},{"path":"skills/atlas-generate-tree/SKILL.md","name":"atlas-generate-tree","description":"Write a complete atlas tree (ATLAS.md + .atlas/) for one repo from a confirmed domain-tag proposal. Performs filesystem writes; six phases with two flat escape hatches (_models/, _entrypoints/) and no per-domain chapter directories.","headings":["Skill: atlas-generate-tree","Inputs","Output","Templates (co-located with this skill)","Six-phase workflow","Phase 1 — Cover and glossary seed","Phase 2 — INDEX.md skeleton","Phase 3 — `dependencies.md` (optional)","Phase 4 — Features (the bulk of the work)","Feature: <name>","Breadcrumb","Domain","Summary","Triggers","Public Interface","Models","Code Paths","External References"],"name_hint":"atlas · 生成 · tree","description_zh":"依据已确认的领域标签方案，为单个仓库分六阶段写入完整 ATLAS.md 与 .atlas/ 地图树，使用 _models/、_entrypoints/ 两个平铺入口，不创建逐领域章节目录。"},{"path":"skills/atlas-identify-domains/SKILL.md","name":"atlas-identify-domains","description":"Propose 3–10 domain tags for a repo before atlas generation — kebab names, rationales, and per-tag feature-count estimates. Use after atlas-survey-repo and before atlas-generate-tree; produces a domain-tag proposal, no files written.","headings":["Skill: atlas-identify-domains","Inputs","Output (returned in conversation, no files written)","Domain-tag proposal: <repo-name>","Tags (3–10)","<tag-kebab>","<next-tag-kebab>","Repo-wide totals","Notes","Procedure","1. Re-read the survey","2. Apply heuristics, in order","3. Estimate per-tag feature count","4. Apply the 50-feature cap","5. Apply the 3–10 tag ceiling","6. Detect shared-model candidates","7. Detect entrypoint-catalog flag","8. Write the proposal"],"name_hint":"atlas · identify · domains","description_zh":"在仓库调查后、地图生成前提出 3 至 10 个领域标签，提供 kebab 命名、理由和各标签的功能数量估计；仅形成方案，不写文件。"},{"path":"skills/atlas-query/SKILL.md","name":"atlas-query","description":"Answer routing, impact-analysis, bug-triage, and cross-repo trace questions using one or more Repo Atlases without reading source code unless the atlas is insufficient. Read-only.","headings":["Skill: atlas-query","Atlas-first reading order","Tree-traversal budget","Recipe 1 — Feature routing","Worked example — single repo","Worked example — multi-repo","Recipe 2 — Impact analysis","Worked example — model change with ≥3 consumers","Worked example — model change with ≤2 consumers","Recipe 3 — Bug triage","Worked example — HTTP symptom","Worked example — domain symptom (no catalog)","Recipe 4 — Cross-repo trace","Procedure","Hop budget","Worked example — binary-drop","Worked example — shared-collection","Citation discipline"],"name_hint":"atlas · 查询","description_zh":"只读使用一个或多个 Repo Atlas 回答代码路由、影响分析、缺陷分诊及跨仓库追踪问题，仅在地图信息不足时读取源代码。"},{"path":"skills/atlas-refresh/SKILL.md","name":"atlas-refresh","description":"Incrementally update an existing atlas to reflect code changes since its last verification, including bridge changes (in atlas.workspace.md), `_models/` promotion/demotion, and cross-repo reciprocity.","headings":["Skill: atlas-refresh","Inputs","Output","1. Staleness check","2. Compute the diff","3. Apply leaf updates","4. Re-evaluate `_models/` thresholds","5. Regenerate `INDEX.md` and `_entrypoints/` catalogs","6. Reciprocal-link maintenance","7. Feature-budget overflow trigger","8. Update `## Last Verified`","9. Hand off to atlas-validate","Layout fork","See also"],"name_hint":"atlas · refresh","description_zh":"根据上次核验后的代码变更增量更新已有仓库地图，包含 atlas.workspace.md 跨仓库连接、_models/ 提升或降低，以及跨仓库相互对应关系。"},{"path":"skills/atlas-survey-repo/SKILL.md","name":"atlas-survey-repo","description":"Read-only reconnaissance of a repository before atlas generation — capture HEAD SHA, manifests, top-level layout, candidate domain tags, and entry-point types. Phase 1 of atlas generation; emits a structured survey note, writes no files.","headings":["Skill: atlas-survey-repo","Inputs","Output (returned in conversation, no files written)","Survey: <repo-name>","Identity","Manifests","Top-level layout","Author intent (READMEs, ARCHITECTURE.md)","CI / deploy","Owners","Candidate features (preliminary, for atlas-identify-domains)","Entry-point inventory","Candidate domain tags (preliminary)","Open questions","Procedure","1. Capture identity","2. Read manifests","3. List top-level layout"],"name_hint":"atlas · survey · repo","description_zh":"在地图生成前只读调查仓库，记录 HEAD SHA、清单、顶层布局、候选领域标签及入口类型；作为第一阶段输出结构化调查记录，不写文件。"},{"path":"skills/atlas-validate/SKILL.md","name":"atlas-validate","description":"Audit an existing Repo Atlas (single repo or workspace) — line budgets, required sections, alphabetical ordering, intra-repo and cross-repo reciprocity, bridge anchor integrity, and `_models/` and `_entrypoints/` thresholds. Read-only.","headings":["Skill: atlas-validate","Inputs","Output","Atlas validation report — <scope>","Hard findings (block completion)","Soft findings (informational)","Summary","Audit categories","B. Line budgets","C. File presence","D. Forbidden directories and files","E. Required sections","F. Path & ordering","G. `_models/` threshold","H. `_entrypoints/` threshold","I. Intra-repo reciprocity","J. Cross-repo reciprocity","K. Knowledge-graph integrity (workspace scope only)"],"name_hint":"atlas · 核验","description_zh":"只读审计单仓库或工作区 Repo Atlas，检查行数预算、必需章节、字母排序、仓库内外对应关系、连接锚点完整性，以及 _models/、_entrypoints/ 阈值。"}],"commands":[],"readmes":[{"path":"README.md","headings":["repo-atlas","What you get","Quickstart","Single repo","Multi-repo workspace","Layouts","Install as a Claude Code plugin","Contributing","License","Status"]},{"path":"examples/billing-service/README.md","headings":["Example: `billing-service` atlas"]}],"mcp_servers":[],"config_names":[],"paths":[".claude-plugin/plugin.json",".gitignore","ATLAS.md","CONTRIBUTING.md","LICENSE","README.md","examples/billing-service/.atlas/INDEX.md","examples/billing-service/.atlas/_models/payment.md","examples/billing-service/.atlas/glossary.md","examples/billing-service/.atlas/issue-refund/feature.md","examples/billing-service/.atlas/list-invoices/feature.md","examples/billing-service/.atlas/record-payment/feature.md","examples/billing-service/ATLAS.md","examples/billing-service/README.md","skills/atlas-bootstrap-workspace/SKILL.md","skills/atlas-bootstrap-workspace/templates/atlas.workspace.md","skills/atlas-bootstrap-workspace/templates/bridge-subse